<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Spectrian Corp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Spectrian Corp raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said it upgraded Spectrian Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $30 a share.</p>
<p>-- said Spectriam should benefit if Northern Telecom Ltd wins a large share of the infrastructure contract from a German personal communication system provider. Spectrian makes linear power amplifiers for wireless communications equipment makers.</p>
<p>-- Spectriam was off 1/4 to 20-5/8.</p>
</text>
